{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29099","headline":"破北虏太和公主归宫阙 · 许浑","name":"破北虏太和公主归宫阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毳幕承秋极断蓬，飘颻一剑黑山空。\n匈奴北走荒秦垒，贵主西还盛汉宫。\n定是庙谟倾种落，必知边寇畏骁雄。\n恩沾残类从归去，莫使华人杂犬戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}